# PyJWT — retained after the MCP OAuth removal (bd-jir0m). The OAuth Bearer-JWT
# verifier was deleted, but the auth test-suite mints JWT-shaped tokens with
# PyJWT to exercise the CD1 no-fail-cascade guard (a JWT-shaped Bearer must be
# rejected and never compared to the static key). Pinned as a direct dependency
# so the test fixtures cannot silently break if a transitive provider drops it.
